			"notes": "**Removed Items and Features**\n- Removed Track\n- Removed Loading Mechanism\n- Changed Ammo Racks to just be a compat block crafted using 9 shells\n\n(These felt unnecessary and were just complicating things)\n\n**Blonk Overhaul**\n- Redstone functionality to Blonks\n- Blonks now have a GUI\n- Recipe is changed to use Dried Kelp instead of Tracks and Piston instead of Loading Mechanism\n- Changed default placing orientation to behave like Furnaces (was previously similar to Observers)\n\n**New Shells**\n- 5 new shell variants - Dragon Shell, HE Shell, HEAT Shell, Nuclear Shell and Smoke Shell\n- Dragon Shell: Non-destructive, spawns a cloud of Dragon's Breath on impact\n- HE Shell: A slightly more powerful shell\n- HEAT Shell: Even stronger and spawns fire too\n- Nuclear Shell: Well.. it's a nuke..\n- Smoke Shell: Non destructive, spawns a \"gas\" cloud on impact"
		},
